di, his assistant and direct witness to the attack), and the massacre at Bologna station—all events that occurred within the span of two years."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/np6F7iYCijkqpoCeGoWFgLj6tt5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/np6F7iYCijkqpoCeGoWFgLj6tt5.jpg","language":"it","width":513,"height":770}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c8tCzamSXndvs9iv0JVwz8qPiCE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c8tCzamSXndvs9iv0JVwz8qPiCE.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zSI8pCgeG4APT70KG3Ooy8Ej4uf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zSI8pCgeG4APT70KG3Ooy8Ej4uf.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/np6F7iYCijkqpoCeGoWFgLj6tt5.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c8tCzamSXndvs9iv0JVwz8qPiCE.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
